/*
 * Declares the Table class.
 *
 * A Table stores the symbols contained inside another symbol. It provides
 * insertion, removal, and lookup operations, including protection-aware
 * filtering and fuzzy search. Tables are used by all Symbol instances to
 * implement hierarchical name resolution.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::table
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/symbol/table.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
